> Should I just grab a marker and finish charging up all this armor?

Have you checked all the stores in the main dungeon to see if there are
any weapons/armor shops that perform enchantment? It is a major waste
to use enchant armor/enchant weapon scrolls for enchantment that can be
done with a shop.

You should also be preparing to harvest barracks/Ludios/the castle for
assault rifles and bullets. This has to be done carefully, because frag
grenades destroy bullets.  The best method I've found for this is a pet
purple worm.  Bullets should be enchanted in bulk, and used with a +5
assault rifle.



